                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr.
                            Scruggs.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1892-09-24"><hi rendition="#italic">September 24,
                        1892</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">South Portland</hi> case fully investigated by Federal
                    courts, New York, and released. Can not interfere.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foster.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
